# @preflight/rules

## Imports

- Own files only.
- Never: `apps/*`, `@preflight/schemas`, Zod runtime, Prisma, GitAgent, `fs`, env, network.

Runtime `dependencies`: `{}`. Vitest is devDependency only.

## Owns

- `StructuredBrief`, det catalog, `applies` / `appliesSpec`, `runDeterministic`, hashes, `diffRulesets`.
- Matchers: one file each under `src/matchers/`. Adversarial cases in same file (up to 300 lines).

## Does not own

- `foldStatus`, human verdicts, HTTP, agent prompts, Prisma.

## Tests (mandatory when touched)

- Each matcher: adversarial cases in-file.
- `runDeterministic`, hashes, `diffRulesets`, `applies` / `appliesSpec`.
- Golden: `golden/` — det must be 100% or don't seed.
- Forbidden: mocking runner/matchers in these tests; changing golden `expected` to match a buggy matcher.

## Signatures (do not change to please callers)

`runDeterministic({ canonicalText, rules })`, `hashRuleset`, `hashRun`, `diffRulesets`.
